		"Details": "The Strider OmniMech is based on the older Cicada BattleMech. The Strider is built on an Endo Steel chassis to help save on weight. Built with a 280 extra light fusion engine, the Strider has a top speed of 118.4 km/h. Outfitted with CASE II, and protected with seven and a half tons of armor, the Strider III is a durable 'Mech for its weight class. The R or Romeo configuration of the Strider III continues the testing captured equipment schtick of almost all variant R mechs in the Inner-sphere.   In this case it is some weirdly new technology recovered in Taurian Space. \n\n <b><color=#e51717>Pafftek Industries Sub-mod</color></b>",
